cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NeuroFlow: joint 3T-to-7T domain translation and super-resolution of cerebrovascular 4D Flow MRI"
abstract: >-
  Supervised deep learning for cerebrovascular 4D Flow MRI. NeuroFlow provides
  CBAM-DNS for same-resolution 3T-to-7T domain translation and CBAM-SupRes for
  joint domain translation and 2x super-resolution, together with the full
  preprocessing, Circle-of-Willis segmentation, and evaluation pipeline.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zheng-sk/NeuroFlow"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-07-30"
keywords:
  - 4D Flow MRI
  - super-resolution
  - domain translation
  - deep learning
  - Circle of Willis
  - cerebrovascular imaging

